---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="找不到頁面">
  <section class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-md text-center">
    <p class="text-6xl">🛍️</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-black">這個櫃位好像撤櫃了</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">找不到你要的頁面，可能網址有誤，或資料已經更新。</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="rounded-full bg-brand px-5 py-2 font-bold text-white">回首頁搜尋</a>
      <a href="/malls/" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-card px-5 py-2">看全部商場</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
